A||||3||william_thorniii||88 DIS Duke - No Spark and No Fuel?||||5||
Z||000000||william_thorniii||01-29-2001||12:40 PM||||Friends,<P>I looked at an 88 DIS DUKE last week.  I am stumped.  I was hoping that some of you could shed some light on the situation.  The symptoms are as follows:  The fuel pump is new, the injector was supposedly replaced and the wires are getting juice.  The injector makes a strange sound (like purging air) when the fuel pump primes with the ign in the acc position.  The rocker arms are turning when the crank spins and fuel comes through the inlet line to the TB.  THe battery is good and was freshly charged.  <P><BR>The problems are that the TB is not spraying fuel and none of the cylinders are getting spark.  It is conceiveable that the wires to the injector were mixed up, any other ideas.  The second problem is that spark is not getting to ANY of the cylinders.  I simply checked this with an inductive timing light (that is known to work).<P>Have at it boys... (and girls)<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||5
Z||000001||TheFiero64||01-29-2001||12:54 PM||||Sometimes a timing light will not pulse at such a low rpm as in cranking. I would add a little fuel or spray a little carb cleaner into the TB to see if it starts. It may be the injector. If there is no spark or fuel check all the fuses and fusible links.||||reg||1
Z||000002||fotofrank||01-29-2001||01:49 PM|||| I had that problem. What I found was an oper wire from the ignition switch to the coil pack.Seems that if this wire is oper the engine cranks but no spark and no gas.<P>------------------<BR>Peace and Happiness<BR>Frank and his fotoflash, an '84 SE 2M4<BR>http://www.homestead.com/fotofrank/foto1.html||||reg||12
Z||000003||theogre||01-29-2001||07:23 PM||||no spark and no fuel. check the fuses. the ECM, DIS Brick, and TBI injector all share the same fuse.<P>after that check the brick and wiring but especially check the crank position sensor. If the sensor is at all damaged just replace the bloody thing. It's like $20 and there is no real way to test it. Read my DIS article for info on the brick. <A HREF="http://fierocave.shorturl.com" TARGET=_blank>The Fiero Cave</A><P>||||reg||1
